## 2. API Documentation

All endpoints are prefixed with `/api`. Most endpoints (except login/register) require a valid JWT token in the `Authorization` header (`Bearer <token>`).

### 2.1 Authentication (`/api/auth`)

| Endpoint | Method | Role | Description | Payload |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/login` | `POST` | Any | Authenticates a user and returns a JWT. | `{ email, password }` |
| `/register` | `POST` | Any | Registers a new student or warden. | `{ name, email, password, role, roomNumber, phone }` |

### 2.2 Complaints (`/api/complaints`)

| Endpoint | Method | Role | Description | Payload (Multipart/form-data) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/` | `POST` | Student | Submits a new voice complaint. Triggers AI triage, deduplication, and saving. | `audio` (File), `browserTranscript` (String, optional) |

### 2.3 Tickets (`/api/tickets`)

| Endpoint | Method | Role | Description | Query / Payload |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/` | `GET` | Warden | Fetches paginated list of all tickets. | Query: `?status=open&category=wifi&page=1&limit=50` |
| `/my` | `GET` | Student | Fetches all tickets submitted by the logged-in student. | *None* |
| `/:id` | `GET` | Both | Fetches a specific ticket. (Students can only view their own). | *None* |
| `/:id/status`| `PATCH`| Warden | Updates a ticket's status. | `{ status: 'resolved' \| 'open' \| 'flagged' }` |
| `/:id` | `DELETE` | Both | Deletes a ticket. | *None* |

